with walking away for you.

20
00:00:45.921 --> 00:00:48.457
For them. For me.

21
00:00:48.557 --> 00:00:50.493
Well. I hope you find it.

22
00:00:50.593 --> 00:00:51.627
Your father's the mission now.

23
00:00:51.694 --> 00:00:52.828
- Why?
- Because this is

24
00:00:52.928 --> 00:00:54.397
